               <msContents>
                  <summary>Metodo Preservativo y Curativo de la Colera morbus dado por un facultativo del Pueblo de Amosoque. 
                     Popular remedies and directions for use during the 1833 cholera epidemic in Mexico. Perhaps from the remedy book of an hacienda.
                                 
              .</summary>
                 
